YANG [address]
  A web browser: 8BML pages, on the whole screen (YING: in a window).
  address: http://host[:port]/path?parameters (http only, no https;
  the network first: NET M4), or a file - A:NAME.8BM, NAME.8BM - read
  from the disc: local pages linked like AmigaGuide's. None: HOME.8BM
  (this drive, else A:, else Z:). A tab: YANG in another slot.
  Keys: G an address typed (Enter goes, ESC not), H home, Tab / right
  the next link, left the one before, up / down a line, Shift + up /
  down a page, Control + up / down the top / end, Enter or Copy the
  link, 1-5 or a tool's capital letter the toolbar, B or DEL back,
  R again, Q or ESC quits.
  Forms: on a text field Enter, then type it (Enter keeps it, ESC
  not); on a choice Enter is its next one; on a button Enter sends
  the form (its fields as the address's parameters - 255 characters
  at most). A mandatory field left empty is chosen instead.
